   Take note of how grey is spelled.  Before everyone flames me on my
spelling, I checked it in the dictionary and both grey and gray are
valid.  Grey is a British spelling (it is often used in Canada
among other places).  I once spent five minutes trying to wish for
different versions of grey dragon scale mail.  I think I ended up
wishing for 3 blessed potions of gain ability.

   Is it too late (or to difficult) to make Nethack recognize both
spellings of grey for pl7?  I know now how Nethack wants it spelled,
but I'm sure that other future hackers might not know.  The only
other word that I can think of with this problem is colour (color),
but I don't think this word is needed for wishing.

